message: "Please cite this software and research artifact when using its code, measurements, or figures. A publication-format preprint has been prepared; its citation will be added when a public record exists."
type: software
title: "OperatorMark: Ownership Evidence in Useful Copies of Neural PDE Operators"
authors:
  - family-names: Chamas
    given-names: Hadi
version: 1.0.0-rc5
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hc1012/OperatorMark"
url: "https://github.com/Hc1012/OperatorMark"
license: MIT
abstract: "A bounded robustness study of active and passive ownership evidence in useful neural PDE copies, including checkpoint-dependent active removal and seven useful solver-corrected copies that defeat both tested signals. The artifact reproduces saved-result analysis of a ten-owner discrete Darcy-flow campaign."
keywords:
  - neural operators
  - model ownership
  - watermarking
  - model extraction
  - PDE
  - reproducibility
